TAC 1, TAC USA, and local community palette refinements
Copyright (c) 2026 Rick Blalock
License: MIT

TAC 1 was generated with Aether. TAC USA is based on Steve Lohmeyer's MIT-licensed Artemis palette.
The Mars palette includes local green and cyan contrast refinements by Rick Blalock.

T3 Code
Source: https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code
Copyright (c) 2026 T3 Tools Inc.
License: MIT

The T3 Code source is referenced for file-format compatibility. No T3 Code source file is copied
into this repository.

